        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9588/60, Contemporary Rectangular Drop Pull Ring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Rectangular Drop Pull Ring is great for cabinets or furniture. This contemporary rectangular ring pull must be mortised (door face cut out) 5/8 inches into the door's face. The mortising can be done with a router or small wood chisel. Choose from an array of stunning finishes for Contemporary Rectangular Ring Pull. This Flush ring pull is 2-3/8 inches in height and 1-7/8 inches in width.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCan be used on sliding by-pass doors. <b>Thru-Bolt mounted</b> from the back side with #8-32 screws (just like a cabinet door pull handle or cabinet knob). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 2-3/8\" Flush Ring Pull:\r\n</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74410-SM.jpg?v=1704354552\" width=\"600\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>***This item is discontinued.  Limited quantities available***</b></p>",
