                "title": "Contemporary Rectangular Ring Pull",
                "description": "The Contemporary Rectangular Drop Pull Ring is great for cabinets or furniture. This contemporary rectangular ring pull must be mortised (door face cut out) 5/8 inches into the door's face. The mortising can be done with a router or small wood chisel. Choose from an array of stunning finishes for Contemporary Rectangular Ring Pull. This Flush ring pull is 2-3/8 inches in height and 1-7/8 inches in width.\r\n",
